      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To calculate safety stock for unpredictable Shenzhen lead times, use the formula: **Safety Stock = (Z-score × Lead Time Deviation) × Average Daily Demand**. You will need to average your historical lead time standard deviation against your daily consumption rate to get accurate inputs. Since battery cells are critical components, I recommend setting your Z-score (service level) high, typically between 2.0 and 2.5, to minimize stockout risks during peak seasons. Finally, combine this safety stock with your current inventory to establish your true reorder point before placing the next order.",
